-- dynamic colors: a color variable names the color; a variable that shadows a
-- palette name wins; a non-color value falls back to the default white
shade is green
shadow is dark gray
red is blue
weird is "not-a-color"
score is 4
clear screen to shade
draw rect at 2, 2 size 4, 4 in shadow
draw circle at 20, 20 size 5 in red
pset 40, 40 in shade
write "hi {shade}" at 2, 20 in weird
show meter score of 10 at 2, 40 in shade
burst 4 sparks at 60, 60 in shadow
